## Fix 1: Replace is_runnable and the verdict logic in moabi-qemu.lua

Open /mnt/d/moabi/src/moabi-qemu.lua. Find the is_runnable function. Replace its **entire body** (from local function is_runnable(path) to its closing end) with this:

lua
local function is_runnable(path)
    local f = io.open(path, "rb")
    if not f then return false end
    local h = f:read(64); f:close()
    if not h or #h < 20 then return false end

    -- Non-ELF: check executable permission
    if h:byte(1) ~= 0x7f or h:byte(2) ~= 0x45
       or h:byte(3) ~= 0x4c or h:byte(4) ~= 0x46 then
        local p = io.popen("test -x " .. shq(path) .. " && echo 1")
        local r = p:read("*l"); p:close()
        return r == "1"
    end

    local le = h:byte(6) == 1
    local et = le and (h:byte(17) + h:byte(18) * 256)
                  or (h:byte(17) * 256 + h:byte(18))

    if et == 1 then return false end  -- ET_REL
    if et == 2 then return true  end  -- ET_EXEC
    if et == 3 then
        -- ET_DYN: runnable if PT_INTERP is present
        local g = io.open(path, "rb")
        if not g then return false end
        local blob = g:read(8192) or ""
        g:close()
        if blob:find("/lib", 1, true) or blob:find("ld-", 1, true) then
            return true
        end
        return false
    end
    return false
end


Now find the is_runnable check in the M.escalate function. The block starts with:

lua
    if not is_runnable(target) then
        result.not_executable = true
        result.error = "target is a library / relocatable object — Tier-2 execution skipped"
        result.signals[#result.signals + 1] = "not a runnable binary (library/object) — Tier-2 execution skipped"
        result.tier2_verdict = "TIER-2 N/A (static artifact)"
        return result
    end


**Replace it** with this single-block version (only one tier2_verdict assignment):

lua
    if not is_runnable(target) then
        result.not_executable = true
        result.error = "target is a library / relocatable object — Tier-2 execution skipped"
        result.signals[#result.signals + 1] =
            "not a runnable binary (library/object) — Tier-2 execution skipped"
        result.tier2_verdict = "TIER-2 N/A (static artifact)"
        return result
    end


