## Fix 3: The moabi-sbom.sh argument order

Open /mnt/d/moabi/src/moabi-sbom.sh (or whatever shell script you use for the batch sweep). Find the loop that calls moabi-reflect.lua. The current line is:

bash
luajit "$REFLECT" "$f" --json --static-only >/dev/null 2>&1


Replace it with:

bash
luajit "$REFLECT" "$f" --static-only >/dev/null 2>&1


This tells moabi-reflect.lua to use its default JSON path (/mnt/d/moabi/reports/<basename>.evidence.json), which is what print_report already does internally.

